Scavenger
=========

Scavenger — Misuse of Error-Handling Code -> QEMU/KVM Escape
Black Hat Asia 2021 — no CVE assigned

Tested:    QEMU 4.2.1 in this repository  (hw/block/nvme.c + dma-helpers.c)
Bug:       The NVMe CMB path reaches qemu_sglist_destroy() with an
           uninitialized stack QEMUSGList, freeing stack garbage as heap
           pointers and opening the way for the published escape chain.
Chain:     NVMe uninitialized free -> virtio-gpu UAF primitive ->
           physmap leak -> QEMU base leak -> timer callback hijack

Run:       /exp
